  <name>ChatGPT</name>
  <summary>Official ChatGPT Desktop Client by OpenAI</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      ChatGPT is the official desktop application for OpenAI's conversational AI assistant and Codex agent.
      It provides intelligent dialogue, coding assistance, multimodal understanding, and local developer workflows.
    </p>
    <p>Key features include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Direct access to OpenAI models including GPT-4o, o1, and specialized developer tools</li>
      <li>Integrated Codex agent capable of analyzing projects and executing sandboxed developer workflows</li>
      <li>Full support for Wayland and X11 with native desktop integration and notifications</li>
      <li>Production-grade Flatpak sandboxing with full read-write workspace and documents support</li>
      <li>Automated updates, offline installation bundles, and self-hosted OSTree repository support</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">com.openai.chatgpt.desktop</launchable>

  <url type="homepage">https://developers.openai.com/codex/app</url>
  <url type="help">https://help.openai.com</url>
